# name clone-url [origin-url]
# Cloned into ~/code/<name> and installed system-wide by system/50-sources.
# Cloned over https, since no ssh key exists yet on a fresh machine; origin
# is then set to origin-url (ssh) so the repo can be pushed to once the key
# is on GitHub (init user-login).
